			<dc:creator>Diego HH</dc:creator>
			<title>Let’s peel the world</title>
			<description>Do you know the interrupted Goode homolosine projection?</description>
			<content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;What would happen if we peeled the Earth like an orange? The
&lt;a href=&quot;https://proj.org/en/stable/operations/projections/igh.html&quot;&gt;interrupted Goode homolosine projection&lt;/a&gt;
gives us something close to that! This equal-area projection preserves relative
areas while splitting the world map into lobes. Add a few shades of orange and
our world is ready to peel.&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded>
			<link>https://dieghernan.github.io/202610_orange-peel/</link>
