			<title>Building a documentation chatbot for Chulapa</title>
			<description>A development diary: context, small screens and useful answers</description>
			<content:encoded>&lt;p&gt;This website uses my &lt;strong&gt;Jekyll&lt;/strong&gt; theme,
&lt;a href=&quot;https://dieghernan.github.io/chulapa&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;chulapa&quot;&gt;Chulapa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. Some time ago, I
started wondering whether I could add a chatbot to its documentation. The docs
